WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.520
Have you ever wondered what SCP-1057, the&nbsp;
Absence of Shark, wants most in the world?

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.400
Foundation staff snapped a&nbsp;
picture of SCP-1057 using SCP-978,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.280
the Desire Camera, while it was being fed&nbsp;
in its aquarium, and this was the result:

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.280
"Being fed a significantly larger&nbsp;
quantity of food in its aquarium."

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:24.560
The absent shark, it seems, is a creature&nbsp;
with simple desires. It just wants food.

